            "dct:title": "3D Reference organ for Breast (mammary gland), Female left",
            "rdfs:comment": "This reference organ, Left-mammary-gland-female (https://humanatlas.io/3d-reference-library) was created using a\ncustom sculpted model to include relevant anatomy for placement of registration blocks. The atlas *Human Microscopic\nAnatomy* (Krstić 1991) and *Atlas of Anatomy* (Gilroy, MacPherson, and Ross 2008) was referenced.\n\n**Bibliography:**\n\n* Gilroy, Anne M., Brian R. MacPherson, and Lawrence M. Ross. 2008. *Atlas of Anatomy*. Thieme.\n* Krstić, Radivoj V. 1991. *Human Microscopic Anatomy*. Berlin, Heidelberg: Springer. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-662-02676-2.",
